    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">内容</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Nanael:_The_Angel_of_Light\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">娜娜艾露：光之天使</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Strategy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">策略</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Vs._Nanael\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">对娜娜艾露</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Overall_Judgement\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">总体评价</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Nanael:_The_Angel_of_Light\">娜娜艾露：光之天使</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNanael_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/e6/Nanael_GB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130617134935\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Nanael GB\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/e6/Nanael_GB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130617134935\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"255\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Nanael GB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Nanael_GB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Nanael_GB.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>体力值：16</li>\n<li>高度：4/6(飞行时)</li>\n<li>攻击：1</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n\n因为惹麻烦而被逐出天界的天使……直白地说很让人头疼！凭借她在战场上飞行和穿梭的能力，她在高度上获得了比其他战士大得多的优势，而且由于她相当扎实的修正值，意味着她能几下就造成高伤害！不过飞行带来的风险与收益并存，娜娜艾露的圣乳有时确实更容易成为麻烦而不是别的……\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Strategy\">策略</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNanael_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1b/Nanaelu_35_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130617135102\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Nanaelu 35 \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1b/Nanaelu_35_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130617135102\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"244\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Nanaelu 35 .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Nanaelu_35_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Nanaelu_35_.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Nanael\" title=\"Nanael\">娜娜艾露</a>  她无疑是一位有趣的斗士，只要看一眼她的页面就会知道，飞行是她的核心机制。在正常情况下，她有基本的挥击、突刺和橙色攻击，不过由于她使用基本刀刃，反而缺乏破坏武器和盾牌的选择。但一旦我们升空，她的选择就变得丰富得多。她的「假动作」变得可及，几乎是一系列安全的选择。她最著名的攻击之一「坠星踢」，其强大之处在于+4的强力修正值，几乎保证击倒，让你在对手被迫跳跃时获得自由控制权来跟进。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/d3/Nanaelu_26_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130617135100\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Nanaelu 26 \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/d3/Nanaelu_26_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130617135100\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"242\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Nanaelu 26 .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Nanaelu_26_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Nanaelu_26_.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>说到飞行，我们来看看高度以及它给娜娜艾露带来的加成。在《女皇之刃》中，当存在高度差时，会给予修正加值和减值。处于优势的一方所有橙色和红色攻击获得+1，而处于劣势的一方所有橙色攻击受到-1。这反过来意味着娜娜艾露可以削弱对手(通常)最强的攻击，同时增强自己的！这意味着在飞行时，只有她的「低位突刺」最终会是负值！一旦她升空并在空中迅速移动，她真的在很多方面开始闪耀！不过最大的好处来自她的体力值，非常漂亮的16，让她在原始生命值上比其他《女皇之刃》书籍更有优势，更多的伤害减免让她感觉像是一位更天界的蕾娜。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vs._Nanael\">对娜娜艾露</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNanael_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/6c/Nanael_12.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130617134934\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Nanael 12\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"244\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Nanael 12.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Nanael_12.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/6c/Nanael_12.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130617134934\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/6c/Nanael_12.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130617134934\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Nanael 12\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/6c/Nanael_12.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130617134934\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"244\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Nanael 12.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Nanael_12.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/6c/Nanael_12.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130617134934\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Nanael_12.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>当然，像飞行这样好的能力总会有一些不足之处，而这正是娜娜艾露最容易被击破的地方。当她处于飞行状态时，会面临被相当痛苦的分数页攻击的风险，并且如果在两次翼伤或一次暴击下，就会失去飞行选项，大大限制了她的行动能力！由于她的许多招式都围绕飞行展开，因此不难猜测一旦进入近距离，她会尝试跳起，给你充足的时间在她行动前将她击落。除此之外，即使拥有生命加成和伤害减免，没有治疗的情况下她仍可能被消耗至死，而如果她在飞行中被抓住，甚至会更迅速地被击败！\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overall_Judgement\">总体评价</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNanael_Guide%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/cc/2P_NANAEL.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130617134933\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"2P NANAEL\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"256\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"2P NANAEL.jpg\" data-image-key=\"2P_NANAEL.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/cc/2P_NANAEL.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130617134933\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/cc/2P_NANAEL.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130617134933\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"2P NANAEL\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/cc/2P_NANAEL.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130617134933\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"256\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"2P NANAEL.jpg\" data-image-key=\"2P_NANAEL.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/cc/2P_NANAEL.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130617134933\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:2P_NANAEL.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>认真来说，娜娜艾露相当扎实。她的特技既能让她获得优势，但若她滥用或变得过于可预测，也会遭到惩罚。她是少数在实用性上达到良好平衡点的角色之一，既不至于强大到无法用聪明战术击破，反过来说，她自己的聪明战术也能为她赢得胜利。总体而言，她与其他人一样是不错的登场角色，她的飞行为战斗增添了有趣的变数。\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>技能等级：高级</b></li>\n<li><b>等级：B</b></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820064942\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 16/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:27212-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260820064942 and revision id 63233. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
